@ItemService_HostAddress = http://localhost:5001

### Report a lost item (requires an auth_token cookie from AuthService login/register+verify).
### Swap COOKIE_VALUE for a real cookie captured from the browser dev tools while testing.
POST {{ItemService_HostAddress}}/api/items/lost
Cookie: auth_token=COOKIE_VALUE
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW

------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Title"

Black leather wallet
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Category"

Wallets
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="Description"

Bifold wallet, slightly worn, lost near the food court.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="DateLost"

2026-08-28
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="LastKnownLocation"

Colombo City Centre, 2nd floor food court
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="HiddenInformation"

Has a torn inner pocket with a faded bus ticket stub inside.
------WebKitFormBoundary7MA4YWxkTrZu0gW--

###

GET {{ItemService_HostAddress}}/api/items/lost/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###
